    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The rain feels like ash on my skin. I'm sitting here in the throne room... or what's left of it. The banners are just rags now. Everything I fought for, every oath I took... it's all gone. There's nothing left in these ruins but the cold and the silence. I look at my hands and I don't even recognize the man who held them. It feels like the story just... ended. Like there's no point in even seeing the sun come up tomorrow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
